## About Brink Design

At Brink Design, I specialize in building practical, high-impact digital solutions that help businesses and organizations thrive online. Whether it's a custom website, a mobile app, or a complete branding refresh, I focus on creating tools that are easy to use and built to grow with you.

## What I Do

- **Web & App Development**: I build fast, responsive websites and apps using frameworks like Next.js, React, and TailwindCSS.
- **Custom Integrations**: From Supabase backends to Shopify stores, I connect the tools that power your business.
- **Ongoing Support**: I offer maintenance, updates, and consulting to keep everything running smoothly long after launch.

## Why Work With Me

I don’t just build things—I build the right things. With a deep understanding of both tech and business, I focus on delivering results, not just features. If you want someone who can speak your language and translate your goals into clean, functional design—let’s talk.
